WEBVTT

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:04.620
Have you spoken with Eriri since?

00:00:04.620 --> 00:00:06.590
Just a little.

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:08.230
You know, Katou,

00:00:08.230 --> 00:00:11.540
Eriri and Utaha-senpai aren't at fault.

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:15.670
I dragged them into the circle against their will to begin with, after all.

00:00:15.670 --> 00:00:17.740
And me, too.

00:00:17.740 --> 00:00:20.450
If they truly are aiming higher as creators,

00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:22.980
if they have a big opportunity in front of them,

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:25.980
they have no reason to stay in a small circle like this.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.320
So...

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:30.130
Don't blame them too much.

00:00:30.890 --> 00:00:32.630
You're good friends, right?

00:00:36.120 --> 00:00:37.270
It's too late now.

00:00:52.520 --> 00:00:55.240
More importantly, let's have fun now!

00:00:55.240 --> 00:00:58.490
We haven't been on a date in a long time.

00:02:37.010 --> 00:02:38.970
Rokutenba Mall...

00:02:39.310 --> 00:02:42.220
All right, let's start with a strategy meeting.

00:02:42.910 --> 00:02:45.720
I'd like to focus on checking out shoes today.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:48.850
So here and here and...

00:02:49.280 --> 00:02:52.690
Okay, Aki-kun, come up with the optimal route.

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.660
Like last time.

00:02:54.660 --> 00:02:55.940
Hey, Katou.

00:02:55.940 --> 00:02:56.570
Hm?

00:02:56.570 --> 00:03:00.270
Are you trying to cheer me up?

00:03:01.260 --> 00:03:04.080
If that's the case, I'm really thankful.

00:03:04.440 --> 00:03:06.990
But you know, you don't need to worry about me that much...

00:03:06.990 --> 00:03:10.130
Well, that's about thirty percent of the reason.

00:03:10.130 --> 00:03:11.920
So what's the rest?

00:03:11.920 --> 00:03:15.940
Twenty percent that I really wanted to come.

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:20.280
Because I haven't gone anywhere yet even though it's spring break.

00:03:20.280 --> 00:03:22.760
That still leaves fifty percent.

00:03:23.670 --> 00:03:28.570
I was left with just one regret
when I last came here with you.

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:29.930
Regret?

00:03:32.260 --> 00:03:35.320
We came here together and we shopped together,

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:38.400
but I was stood up and couldn't go home together.

00:03:42.130 --> 00:03:44.700
I am terribly sorry!

00:03:45.270 --> 00:03:46.660
And so,

00:03:47.580 --> 00:03:50.410
today I'll have you stay with me until the end.

00:03:50.850 --> 00:03:52.420
Yes!

00:03:58.210 --> 00:03:59.650
Hey, Aki-kun.

00:03:59.650 --> 00:04:00.900
Ah, Katou.

00:04:00.900 --> 00:04:04.390
For our next store, it might be better to flow towards the west...

00:04:04.390 --> 00:04:06.600
Ah, that's not what I mean.

00:04:06.600 --> 00:04:08.210
Which one is better?

00:04:08.210 --> 00:04:09.140
Huh?

00:04:09.140 --> 00:04:12.080
I like the colour on this better,

00:04:12.080 --> 00:04:14.150
but maybe this has a nicer design?

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.690
Uh, even if you ask me...

00:04:16.690 --> 00:04:19.280
You can just say what you think.

00:04:19.280 --> 00:04:20.540
Hey, stop!

00:04:20.540 --> 00:04:23.900
Do you understand just how difficult it is for an otaku to choose clothes?

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:24.840
It is?

00:04:24.840 --> 00:04:25.870
It is!

00:04:25.870 --> 00:04:29.600
I don't know much about it, have no fashion sense, nor any money to spend on clothes.

00:04:29.600 --> 00:04:32.750
I can't have confidence in my opinion that lightly!

00:04:32.750 --> 00:04:35.750
Huh, so that's how it is.

00:04:35.750 --> 00:04:37.180
Y-Yes.

00:04:37.180 --> 00:04:39.660
So I'm sorry, but ask the employees or-

00:04:39.660 --> 00:04:40.670
In that case,

00:04:40.670 --> 00:04:43.970
I'll try it on, so you can take your time to choose.

00:04:43.970 --> 00:04:45.010
Listen to what I say-

00:04:54.920 --> 00:04:56.480
Sorry to make you wait...

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:57.560
Did you get tired?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.070
Not physically but mentally!

00:05:00.380 --> 00:05:01.300
So what's next?

00:05:01.300 --> 00:05:02.600
A break?

00:05:02.600 --> 00:05:05.590
There's just one place left, so let's go there.

00:05:05.590 --> 00:05:07.200
Okay, sure thing.

00:05:08.190 --> 00:05:09.580
I'll carry that.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:13.080
Last year there was a huge crowd from here onward.

00:05:22.040 --> 00:05:23.050
Don't run.

00:05:23.520 --> 00:05:26.550
As long as you don't run, I'm fine.

00:05:26.550 --> 00:05:28.180
Don't fall.

00:05:28.180 --> 00:05:32.010
As long as you open the path, I'm fine.

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:33.480
And...

00:05:33.480 --> 00:05:34.770
Don't let go.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:39.660
As long as you hold on tight, I'm fine.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:07.490
Thanks for everything!

00:06:07.490 --> 00:06:10.070
Now we're done with everything.

00:06:10.070 --> 00:06:11.030
What now?

00:06:11.030 --> 00:06:12.050
Take a break?

00:06:12.050 --> 00:06:13.890
Or go home already?

00:06:14.500 --> 00:06:15.580
Hey, Katou.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:16.390
Huh?

00:06:16.740 --> 00:06:20.750
Sorry, but would you go to one more shop with me?

00:06:20.750 --> 00:06:21.540
Huh?

00:06:25.650 --> 00:06:27.270
This place...

00:06:36.520 --> 00:06:37.660
Hey, Katou.

00:06:39.720 --> 00:06:44.000
The hat you wore back then was like this, right?

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:45.840
Ah...

00:06:47.020 --> 00:06:49.970
It's to thank you for taking me here today.

00:06:49.970 --> 00:06:55.970
And I haven't given you anything in return for the glasses you gave me as a present last time, either.

00:06:55.970 --> 00:06:58.260
Thank you, Katou.

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:02.670
You're welcome.

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:06.700
Hey, Katou.

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:09.740
Would it have been better to exchange that for something else after all?

00:07:09.740 --> 00:07:11.160
No way!

00:07:11.160 --> 00:07:13.320
But when you think about it,

00:07:13.320 --> 00:07:16.300
the one you had earlier was
pretty much the same, wasn't it?

00:07:16.300 --> 00:07:18.250
It's good because it's the same.

00:07:18.250 --> 00:07:20.940
Also, it's pretty much the same,

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:23.000
but it's not the same at all.

00:07:23.520 --> 00:07:25.250
I don't get you.

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:41.270
Hey, Tomoya-kun.

00:07:41.270 --> 00:07:47.300
Is the heroine of your new story something like this?

00:07:47.300 --> 00:07:48.280
Huh?

00:07:48.280 --> 00:07:54.580
Is a date event in your new story something like this?

00:07:54.580 --> 00:07:55.660
Katou...

00:07:55.660 --> 00:08:05.540
Did you feel suffocated, tantalised and excited, like you'd fallen in love with a real girl?

00:08:06.590 --> 00:08:10.720
The time you spend with the heroine feels precious in itself,

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.680
and you fall in love with her from the bottom of your heart...

00:08:13.680 --> 00:08:18.180
Did this work as motivation to make a story like that?

00:08:18.180 --> 00:08:22.140
Are you telling me that the real reason you invited me today...

00:08:22.830 --> 00:08:25.400
I won't give up, Tomoya-kun.

00:08:25.870 --> 00:08:29.900
Even if Eriri goes away, even if
Kasumigaoka-senpai goes away,

00:08:30.340 --> 00:08:33.650
Blessing Software won't go away.

00:08:34.110 --> 00:08:36.490
As long as you're there, Tomoya-kun.

00:08:38.800 --> 00:08:39.910
Yeah!

00:08:40.590 --> 00:08:42.650
As long as I'm there,

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:44.830
as long as you and me are there,

00:08:44.830 --> 00:08:46.420
it won't go away!

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:55.180
I want to continue the circle.

00:08:55.650 --> 00:08:56.400
Yeah.

00:08:59.430 --> 00:09:03.180
I want to do another game!

00:09:03.920 --> 00:09:04.750
Yeah!

00:09:17.970 --> 00:09:19.600
So Megumi,

00:09:19.600 --> 00:09:22.950
become my main heroine once more!

00:09:31.070 --> 00:09:37.050
Turn me once again into a main heroine anyone would envy!

00:10:54.320 --> 00:10:56.340
This way, Sawamura-san.

00:10:56.750 --> 00:10:59.280
Why didn't we go with a green car?

00:10:59.280 --> 00:11:03.970
We can't just ask a client we're going to meet for the first time for a green car ticket.

00:11:03.970 --> 00:11:07.520
In a green car, I could've got some work done on the way, too.

00:11:07.520 --> 00:11:11.770
You sure got enthusiastic about work after breaking out of your slump.

00:11:11.770 --> 00:11:13.650
This is the real me.

00:11:14.120 --> 00:11:15.400
Also...

00:11:16.610 --> 00:11:20.150
We cast aside too much to take this job lightly.

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:23.160
You're right.

00:11:28.660 --> 00:11:30.700
All right, we're boarding.

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:32.420
Being completely the away team.

00:11:32.740 --> 00:11:34.170
Are you ready?

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:36.920
I won't look back.

00:11:40.370 --> 00:11:41.180
Hey!

00:11:41.620 --> 00:11:42.680
Eriri!

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:44.680
Utaha-senpai!

00:11:51.250 --> 00:11:52.360
That's good!

00:11:52.360 --> 00:11:54.080
Somehow I made it!

00:11:55.820 --> 00:11:57.490
T-Tomo...

00:11:57.490 --> 00:11:58.750
Tomoya-kun...

00:11:58.750 --> 00:12:01.700
H-H... h-h...

00:12:01.700 --> 00:12:04.970
Um, Tomoya-kun, how are you here?

00:12:04.970 --> 00:12:07.230
Machida-san told me.

00:12:07.230 --> 00:12:09.790
That you two were going to Osaka today.

00:12:09.790 --> 00:12:11.460
It's starting, right?

00:12:11.460 --> 00:12:13.710
Do your best, you two!

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:16.740
B-B... y-y... d-d...

00:12:16.740 --> 00:12:20.080
But you didn't agree to this, did you?

00:12:20.080 --> 00:12:21.970
Also, Sawamura-san, calm down a little.

00:12:21.970 --> 00:12:24.800
Shut up, Kasumigaoka Utaha!

00:12:24.800 --> 00:12:27.050
It's not about whether I agree or not.

00:12:27.050 --> 00:12:29.570
It's Fields Chronicle, after all!

00:12:29.570 --> 00:12:31.580
The famous Fields Chronicle!

00:12:31.580 --> 00:12:36.640
It'll definitely be a god-tier game if you two make it!

00:12:36.640 --> 00:12:38.570
I'm rooting for you!

00:12:38.570 --> 00:12:41.420
I'll support it all the way on my blog, show it to all my friends,

00:12:41.420 --> 00:12:44.230
and buy as many copies as there are store exclusives!

00:12:44.230 --> 00:12:45.360
Tomoya...

00:12:46.060 --> 00:12:47.690
Tomoya...

00:12:47.690 --> 00:12:49.550
So do your best, Eriri.

00:12:51.540 --> 00:12:56.630
But I hurt Megumi too, not just you...

00:12:57.180 --> 00:13:01.050
She'll want to cut ties, and she'll never forgive me...

00:13:01.050 --> 00:13:02.660
Do you really think so?

00:13:02.660 --> 00:13:03.380
Huh?

00:13:14.150 --> 00:13:16.100
<i>Do your best, Eriri.</i>

00:13:16.570 --> 00:13:19.110
<i>Sorry I couldn't come see you off.</i>

00:13:19.110 --> 00:13:21.750
<i>But I'm rooting for you!</i>

00:13:23.020 --> 00:13:26.950
<i>And I'll keep waiting for you to come back.</i>

00:13:29.540 --> 00:13:32.120
Megumi!

00:13:32.590 --> 00:13:34.840
So don't cry.

00:13:34.840 --> 00:13:36.860
But... but...

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:38.300
You want to do it, don't you?

00:13:38.300 --> 00:13:39.880
You want to succeed, don't you?

00:13:40.260 --> 00:13:42.630
You want to become a god-tier illustrator, don't you?

00:13:42.630 --> 00:13:45.200
So become one!

00:13:45.200 --> 00:13:47.010
Make me proud!

00:13:47.010 --> 00:13:50.600
Make me boast to everybody how I'm Kashiwagi Eri's childhood friend!

00:13:51.300 --> 00:13:52.360
I'll do it.

00:13:53.790 --> 00:13:57.590
I'll become a god-tier illustrator and definitely make you cry!

00:13:57.590 --> 00:13:59.690
Together with Kasumigaoka Utaha!

00:14:01.350 --> 00:14:04.690
Utaha-senpai, take care of Eriri.

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:06.660
Leave it to me.

00:14:06.660 --> 00:14:09.370
Don't get eaten alive by Kousaka Akane.

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:12.470
Who do you think we are?

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:13.450
Right.

00:14:14.070 --> 00:14:15.380
And you, too.

00:14:15.380 --> 00:14:17.210
Good luck on your new game.

00:14:17.210 --> 00:14:18.450
Yeah.

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:21.250
This time I'll create a legend.

00:14:21.250 --> 00:14:22.770
I'm waiting for it.

00:14:22.770 --> 00:14:24.290
You won't laugh?

00:14:24.290 --> 00:14:26.420
I won't.

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:29.100
There's no way I would.

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:34.680
Since that's one reason I'm getting away from you.

00:14:34.680 --> 00:14:36.050
Huh?

00:14:36.050 --> 00:14:38.940
When you're not relying or depending on anyone...

00:14:39.320 --> 00:14:42.670
I wanted to see your complete devotion.

00:14:42.670 --> 00:14:44.760
Utaha-senpai...

00:14:44.760 --> 00:14:46.310
So Tomoya-kun,

00:14:46.310 --> 00:14:48.450
live up to to my expectations.

00:14:48.720 --> 00:14:49.720
No,

00:14:49.720 --> 00:14:51.450
surpass my expectations.

00:14:53.020 --> 00:14:53.770
Yeah.

00:14:54.450 --> 00:14:55.760
Well then,

00:14:55.760 --> 00:14:57.450
see you!

00:15:00.180 --> 00:15:01.460
Tomoya.

00:15:01.960 --> 00:15:03.930
Give me these.

00:15:03.930 --> 00:15:04.960
Eriri?

00:15:05.560 --> 00:15:08.720
I can have them, right?

00:15:10.130 --> 00:15:10.990
Sure.

00:15:10.990 --> 00:15:12.220
Take them.

00:15:12.650 --> 00:15:15.450
Tomoya, I...

00:15:17.030 --> 00:15:18.230
I...

00:15:18.940 --> 00:15:20.230
Huh?

00:15:39.260 --> 00:15:42.180
Morals-kun...

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:43.310
No,

00:15:43.310 --> 00:15:45.540
from now on you're Immoral-kun.

00:15:47.160 --> 00:15:49.340
Why won't you let me give up?

00:15:49.910 --> 00:15:52.360
Why won't you let me forget?

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:54.020
Utaha-senpai, what did you just-

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:55.850
All right, I got it.

00:15:55.850 --> 00:15:58.120
I'm determined too.

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:00.020
I'll let you keep me out of pity.

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.360
I'll let you keep killing me!

00:16:01.360 --> 00:16:02.850
I'm not doing either!

00:16:02.850 --> 00:16:06.110
I'll give up on giving up.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:11.240
K-Kasumigaoka Utaha!

00:16:12.220 --> 00:16:14.780
What did you do?!

00:16:14.780 --> 00:16:16.960
I was going to...

00:16:16.960 --> 00:16:18.120
I was...

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:21.000
But you'll still be in the same school, right?

00:16:21.360 --> 00:16:22.700
If you did something like that,

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:24.950
you'd feel so awkward you couldn't face each other at school.

00:16:24.950 --> 00:16:28.070
As if I'd pair up with you, after all!

00:16:28.070 --> 00:16:30.630
It's a completely different issue, isn't it?

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:31.880
Well,

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:35.510
I do understand feeling jealous of his first woman.

00:16:36.270 --> 00:16:37.640
Hey, you two!

00:16:37.640 --> 00:16:41.250
If you keep messing around here, the Shinkansen will leave-

00:16:43.270 --> 00:16:44.940
Shinkansen?

00:16:45.730 --> 00:16:47.620
Where is it?

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:30.100
M-Morning, um...

00:18:30.100 --> 00:18:31.210
...Megumi.

00:18:32.180 --> 00:18:34.210
Morning, Tomo-

00:18:35.720 --> 00:18:37.240
Ah, this?

00:18:37.240 --> 00:18:40.220
Well, I lost my usual ones...

00:18:40.880 --> 00:18:41.990
What do you think?

00:18:43.920 --> 00:18:45.220
Megumi?

00:18:45.220 --> 00:18:47.150
T-They suit you.

00:18:47.150 --> 00:18:49.930
Yeah, they suit you really well.

00:18:49.930 --> 00:18:50.730
Hey.

00:18:50.730 --> 00:18:53.730
T-They're really cool.

00:18:53.730 --> 00:18:56.140
I'll tell you later how good it looks,

00:18:56.140 --> 00:18:59.200
so give me just a little time now.

00:18:59.200 --> 00:19:01.040
Why are you laughing, Katou?!

00:19:01.040 --> 00:19:04.020
Are you completely denying an otaku trying to be a bit more fashionable?

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:07.620
I-I'm sorry, I was just a bit surprised...

00:19:07.620 --> 00:19:08.630
Katou!

00:19:08.630 --> 00:19:10.450
Hey, stop...

00:19:11.210 --> 00:19:14.710
And anyway, these are the ones you gave me last year!

00:19:15.100 --> 00:19:17.100
Stop even denying your own fashion sense!

00:19:17.100 --> 00:19:20.400
Ah, come to think of it, something like that might have happened.

00:19:20.400 --> 00:19:23.220
Ah, I see how it is, that's how well you recognise them.

00:19:23.690 --> 00:19:24.720
Whatever!

00:19:24.720 --> 00:19:26.950
I'll go for contacts from now on!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.740
Yeah, I think that might be better.

00:19:39.740 --> 00:19:40.980
Katou.

00:19:40.980 --> 00:19:45.690
Even when we're third-years, you're still as haphazard towards me as always.

00:19:45.690 --> 00:19:51.470
You know, perhaps it's because you're as rude to me as always.

00:19:51.470 --> 00:19:52.750
Ah, sheesh!

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:57.080
You were such a good main heroine the other day, too!

00:19:57.080 --> 00:20:00.510
I don't think I'm any different from back then, though.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.220
No, you're completely changed, a different person!

00:20:03.560 --> 00:20:07.100
Back then you were truly cute and kind,

00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:08.470
moe and worrying,

00:20:08.470 --> 00:20:10.820
making me want to roll on the ground!.

00:20:10.820 --> 00:20:15.280
If that's how you react, I'll just feel more like not doing my best.

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:18.730
And also, the way you called me, you know!

00:20:19.910 --> 00:20:23.220
Huh, did my tongue slip at some point?

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.230
"Tomoya-kun!", you called me!

00:20:25.230 --> 00:20:26.490
"Tomoya-kun!"

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.430
Tomoya-senpai!

00:20:29.430 --> 00:20:33.750
Ah, should I say that I have no idea what you're talking about,

00:20:33.750 --> 00:20:36.670
or that I rather regret it now...

00:20:36.670 --> 00:20:38.300
You said it, you definitely did!

00:20:38.300 --> 00:20:40.540
At the top of that sunset-lit hill, "Tomoya-kun!"

00:20:40.540 --> 00:20:42.190
Tomoya-senpai!

00:20:42.190 --> 00:20:44.340
See? Like that!

00:20:44.790 --> 00:20:45.570
Huh?

00:20:46.340 --> 00:20:48.070
Izumi-chan?

00:20:48.070 --> 00:20:52.430
Hashima Izumi, starting in Toyogasaki Academy today!

00:20:52.430 --> 00:20:55.100
Let's get along in the future, too!

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:58.990
U-Um, Izumi-chan, weren't you going to a prefectural school...?

00:20:58.990 --> 00:20:59.520
Huh?

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:00.550
I did apply,

00:21:00.550 --> 00:21:04.010
but I got into Toyogasaki as my first option, so I didn't go.

00:21:04.010 --> 00:21:04.820
<i>It's fine!</i>

00:21:04.820 --> 00:21:08.600
<i>We've already found a place where Izumi can best demonstrate her skills!</i>

00:21:08.600 --> 00:21:10.090
That bastard...

00:21:10.090 --> 00:21:11.870
This is what he meant?

00:21:13.360 --> 00:21:15.470
Tomoya-senpai?

00:21:15.470 --> 00:21:17.880
Congratulations on getting in, Izumi-chan.

00:21:18.290 --> 00:21:20.460
Let's do our best together.

00:21:21.180 --> 00:21:22.460
Yes!

00:21:24.980 --> 00:21:29.420
It's disgraceful how well acting like a loser always suits you, Sawamura-san.

00:21:29.420 --> 00:21:32.010
What are you doing here, you graduate?

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:35.690
I can stand on any public road I wish, can't I?

00:21:35.690 --> 00:21:39.910
You're already done making memories, too, so get moving already!

00:21:39.910 --> 00:21:43.900
You can't keep being that stubborn even when you're in university.

00:21:43.900 --> 00:21:47.330
That's right, you two quit the circle, too.

00:21:47.330 --> 00:21:51.180
It's too selfish of you to want to go back at this point.

00:21:51.180 --> 00:21:53.670
What did you come here for, miss from-another-school?

00:21:53.670 --> 00:21:56.700
What about your school's opening ceremony?

00:21:56.700 --> 00:21:57.370
Well,

00:21:57.370 --> 00:22:02.290
I heard from Tomo that we're restarting our
circle activities this afternoon after a long break,

00:22:02.290 --> 00:22:04.880
so I couldn't help myself any more!

00:22:04.880 --> 00:22:07.980
It's too late to appeal with your presence!

00:22:07.980 --> 00:22:10.270
We're in the C part of the last episode already!

00:22:10.270 --> 00:22:13.880
You were practically absent for the last half, weren't you?

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:16.730
What are you trying to do at this point?

00:22:17.180 --> 00:22:22.840
Well, what I can and can't do depends on future developments, right?

00:22:22.840 --> 00:22:24.920
And so...

00:22:24.920 --> 00:22:25.900
Wait!

00:22:25.900 --> 00:22:26.720
I won't let you go!

00:22:26.720 --> 00:22:29.170
I won't allow just you to act like a friend!

00:22:29.170 --> 00:22:30.510
Let go of me!

00:22:30.510 --> 00:22:31.740
Miss pointless boobs!

00:22:31.740 --> 00:22:35.580
I really am a friend!
